hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"593","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Huzail ki do aurten; un mein se ek ne dusri ko mara aur us ka hamal gira diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein ghurrah: Ghulam ya bandi ka faisla farmaya."
"594","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us janin ka faisla farmaya jo apni man ke pet mein qatl kiya jae, ghurrah: Ghulam ya bandi ke sath. To jis par faisla farmaya gaya us ne kaha: Main us ka tawan kaise dun jo na piya, na khaya, na bola, aur na roya; aur aise ka [tawan] batil hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak yeh kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai [kahinon ke saj' jaise saj'dar kalam].'"
"595","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Allah ki yaad dilata hun us aadmi ko jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko janin ke bare mein kisi cheez ka faisla farmate suna. To Hamal bin Malik bin Nabighah khade hue aur kaha: Ai Ameerul-Mumineen, main apni do bandiyon ke darmiyan tha, yani do sautan; un mein se ek dusri ki taraf apne ghar ke kheme ke sutoon se uthi aur us se use mara; us ne use qatl kiya aur jo us ke pet mein tha use qatl kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke janin mein ghurrah: Ghulam ya bandi ka faisla farmaya. To Umar ne kaha: Allahu Akbar; agar ham ne yeh na suna hota to ham us ke siwa faisla farmate."
"596","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Urainah ke chand log Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur unhen Madinah raas na aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kash tum hamare oonton ki taraf niklo aur un ke doodhon aur peshabon se piyo.' To unhon ne aisa kiya [shifa pai], Islam se murtad hue, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke charwahe ko qatl kiya, aur Aap ke oont hank kar le gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ki talash mein bheja; Aap ne un ke hath paon kate, un ki aankhen daghin, aur unhen Harrah mein chhor diya yahan tak ke mar gae."
"597","[AI-translation] Siqah ravi se Humaid se Anas bin Malik se is hadees jaise ma'na ki Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai; Anas ne us mein izafa farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ke ba'd jis khutbe se khitab farmaya us mein muslah [aaza katne] se mana farmaya."
"598","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad ke walid [Muhammad Baqir] se apne dada [Ali bin Husain] (Rahimahumallah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aankh nahin dagi, aur ahle liqah [jin ke doodh ke oont loote gae] par hath paon katne ke siwa izafa nahin farmaya."
"599","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Talhah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ko seeng us ke paon mein lagi; woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe qisas dilayen. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Intezar karo.' Woh Aap ke paas wapas aaya; Aap ne farmaya: 'Intezar karo.' Woh Aap ke paas wapas aaya; Aap ne farmaya: 'Intezar karo.' Woh Aap ke paas wapas aaya; Aap ne use qisas dilaya. To jis se qisas liya gaya us ka paon theek ho gaya, dusre [muddai] ka paon sookh gaya. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ka paon theek ho gaya jabke mera paon sookh gaya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ne tum se kaha tha: Intezar karo'; aur Aap ne us ke liye kuch na dekha [koi izafi tawan nahin]."
"600","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaifah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Kya tumhare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Quran ke siwa ilm hai? To unhon ne kaha: 'Nahin; qasam Us ki jis ne dane ko phada aur jaan ko paida farmaya; hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Quran ke siwa kuch nahin, siwae is ke ke Allah bande ko Quran mein fehem ata farmaye, aur jo saheefe mein hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Saheefe mein kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: 'Aql [diyat], qaidi ko chhudana, aur Musalman kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jata.'"
"601","[AI-translation] Ata, Taus, Mujahid aur Hasan (Rahimahumallah) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath [Makkah] wale saal apne khutbe mein farmaya: 'Momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jata.'"
